Backport of duckdb/duckdb#28879 (98f3ef4336d): fix pushed-down extracts of
nested fields that differ between files.

In v2.0.0, extracting a field from a struct column that a Parquet file does
not have and that the schema= option fills from default_value throws an
INTERNAL error. pg_lake reads Iceberg columns added after a data file was
written this way, and the error takes down pgduck_server.

